n="00:23.520" end="00:23.730">up </span><span begin="00:23.730" end="00:23.910">'cause </span><span begin="00:23.910" end="00:24.000">you </span><span begin="00:24.000" end="00:24.270">know </span><span begin="00:24.270" end="00:24.450">that </span><span begin="00:24.450" end="00:24.630">it's </span><span begin="00:24.630" end="00:24.900">all </span><span begin="00:24.900" end="00:25.170">l</span><span begin="00:25.170" end="00:25.320">-</span><span begin="00:25.320" end="00:25.350">o</span><span begin="00:25.350" end="00:25.380">-</span><span begin="00:25.380" end="00:25.890">v</span><span begin="00:25.890" end="00:25.920">-</span><span begin="00:25.920" end="00:25.950">e</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.950" end="00:31.140"><span begin="00:25.950" end="00:26.220">Like </span><span begin="00:26.220" end="00:26.460">uh</span><span begin="00:26.460" end="00:26.610">, </span><span begin="00:26.610" end="00:27.000">tell </span><span begin="00:27.000" end="00:27.300">me</span><span begin="00:27.300" end="00:27.660">, </span><span begin="00:27.660" end="00:28.740">baby</span><span begin="00:28.740" end="00:29.190">, </span><span begin="00:29.190" end="00:29.280">do </span><span begin="00:29.280" end="00:29.400">you </span><span begin="00:29.400" end="00:29.730">miss </span><span begin="00:29.730" end="00:29.880">me </span><span begin="00:29.880" end="00:30.660">still</span><span begin="00:30.660" end="00:31.140">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.140" end="00:35.040"><span begin="00:31.140" end="00:31.290">Do </span><span begin="00:31.290" end="00:31.410">i </span><span begin="00:31.410" end="00:31.590">ever </span><span begin="00:31.590" end="00:31.980">cross </span><span begin="00:31.980" end="00:32.190">your </span><span begin="00:32.190" end="00:32.550">mind </span><span begin="00:32.550" end="00:32.670">or </span><span begin="00:32.670" end="00:32.820">is </span><span begin="00:32.820" end="00:33.000">all </span><span begin="00:33.000" end="00:33.150">that </span><span begin="00:33.150" end="00:33.570">behind </span><span begin="00:33.570" end="00:33.630">us</span><span begin="00:33.630" end="00:33.690">? </span><span begin="00:33.690" end="00:33.900">'Cause </span><span begin="00:33.900" end="00:34.050">i </span><span begin="00:34.050" end="00:34.380">can't </span><span begin="00:34.380" end="00:35.040">tell</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.340" end="00:39.810"><span begin="00:35.340" end="00:35.760">Tell </span><span begin="00:35.760" end="00:36.030">me</span><span begin="00:36.030" end="00:36.390">, </span><span begin="00:36.390" end="00:37.470">baby</span><span begin="00:37.470" end="00:37.920">, </span><span begin="00:37.920" end="00:38.040">do </span><span begin="00:38.040" end="00:38.130">you </span><span begin="00:38.130" end="00:38.490">miss </span><span begin="00:38.490" end="00:38.610">me </span><span begin="00:38.610" end="00:39.420">still</span><span begin="00:39.420" end="00:39.810">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.810" end="00:41.220"><span begin="00:39.810" end="00:40.140">Even </span><span begin="00:40.140" end="00:40.230">though </span><span begin="00:40.230" end="00:40.440">you </span><span begin="00:40.440" end="00:40.650">act </span><span begin="00:40.650" end="00:40.770">like </span><span begin="00:40.770" end="00:40.920">i'm </span><span begin="00:40.920" end="00:41.220">dead</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.220" end="00:43.650"><span begin="00:41.220" end="00:41.430">i'ma </span><span begin="00:41.430" end="00:41.760">love </span><span begin="00:41.760" end="00:41.850">you </span><span begin="00:41.850" end="00:42.390">forever</span><span begin="00:42.390" end="00:42.390">, </span><span begin="00:42.390" end="00:42.570">that's </span><span begin="00:42.570" end="00:42.840">just </span><span begin="00:42.840" end="00:42.960">how </span><span begin="00:42.960" end="00:43.050">i </span><span begin="00:43.050" end="00:43.650">feel</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="