 end="00:51.270">i'd </span><span begin="00:51.270" end="00:51.570">call </span><span begin="00:51.570" end="00:51.720">you </span><span begin="00:51.720" end="00:51.840">and </span><span begin="00:51.840" end="00:52.170">tell </span><span begin="00:52.170" end="00:52.470">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.560" end="00:54.330"><span begin="00:52.560" end="00:52.890">Okay</span><span begin="00:52.890" end="00:52.890">, </span><span begin="00:52.890" end="00:53.070">i'm </span><span begin="00:53.070" end="00:53.160">a </span><span begin="00:53.160" end="00:53.400">lil' </span><span begin="00:53.400" end="00:53.760">drunk </span><span begin="00:53.760" end="00:54.000">right </span><span begin="00:54.000" end="00:54.330">now</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.330" end="00:56.640"><span begin="00:54.330" end="00:54.510">I'm </span><span begin="00:54.510" end="00:54.810">tryna </span><span begin="00:54.810" end="00:55.110">come </span><span begin="00:55.110" end="00:55.410">through </span><span begin="00:55.410" end="00:55.500">if </span><span begin="00:55.500" end="00:55.740">you </span><span begin="00:55.740" end="00:55.920">up </span><span begin="00:55.920" end="00:56.190">right </span><span begin="00:56.190" end="00:56.640">now</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.670" end="00:58.680"><span begin="00:56.670" end="00:56.893">Been </span><span begin="00:56.893" end="00:57.116">six </span><span begin="00:57.116" end="00:57.339">months </span><span begin="00:57.339" end="00:57.562">since </span><span begin="00:57.562" end="00:57.785">the </span><span begin="00:57.785" end="00:58.008">last </span><span begin="00:58.008" end="00:58.231">time </span><span begin="00:58.231" end="00:58.454">we </span><span begin="00:58.454" end="00:58.680">talked</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.680" end="01:01.230"><span begin="00:58.680" end="00:58.800">But </span><span begin="00:58.800" end="00:58.860">i </span><span begin="00:58.860" end="00:59.190">think </spa